reconfigure_confirm.description:
Review the changes before applying them.

**New devices ({added_count}):** {added}

**Updated devices ({changed_count}):** {changed}

**No longer in your Cync account ({removed_count}):** {removed}

**Unchanged:** {unchanged_count}

Devices missing from your Cync account are kept by default. Removing one deletes its entities and breaks anything that references them, and devices can drop out of the list temporarily when the Cync API responds partially.
